      "statement": "KeyGenerator feeds both cache addressing surfaces: ChatCacheKey.of and EmbeddingCacheKey.of derive localKey via generateKey(content), which is how LocalCache maps identical content to the same entry inside its file (put and get both address entries by cacheKey.localKey()), and CachedEmbeddingCreator logs generateKey(content) when calculating or failing to calculate an embedding so log lines reference exactly the file-cache identifier.",
