    {
      "id": "claim_cb75e28ff3034d3d93bc2eeff7b6cbb4",
      "statement": "The concrete cache parameters are built directly from model configuration: ChatModelProvider.cacheParameters() returns new ChatCacheParameter(modelName, seed, temperature), and CachedEmbeddingCreator's constructor creates new EmbeddingCacheParameter(model) and immediately obtains its cache via cacheManager.getCache(this, embeddingCacheParameter), so the model settings alone determine both the cache file identity and the key identity.",
